; WDSTUB.DEF - module definition for the WDSTUB link/size check.
; NOT SHIPPED.  Open Watcom wlink does not read a .DEF file; the same
; settings are given to wlink as directives (see the build notes in
; the WDWIN report).  This file records the intended module attributes.
NAME        WDSTUB
EXETYPE     WINDOWS
STUB        'WINSTUB.EXE'
CODE        MOVEABLE
DATA        MOVEABLE MULTIPLE
HEAPSIZE    1024
STACKSIZE   5120
